{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And the waters covered their adversaries</b> — Pharaoh and his army, and so it is written: \"and Pharaoh and his army were hurled\" [n]."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 106, :notes {0 "The citation \"ונער פרעה וחילו\" does not correspond verbatim to any standard biblical verse; it may be a paraphrase of Exodus 15:4 (ונער פרעה וחילו לים) cited from memory or reflecting a variant reading."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:38:41.697733515Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}